(text "NOR3_N16: two three-input NORs, Yi = ~(Ai | Bi | Ci). 3 tubes = 2 cells (liberty: 1.5 per cell).\nЛ1: A1, B1 -> Y1. Л2 is shared: C1 -> Y1, A2 -> Y2. Л3: B2, C2 -> Y2. Ra 10k (2 W) + L 680u || 10k on each Y (as NOR2_N16).\nA, B, C: LV (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V), each on a triode grid (divider C1 3.9 pF per grid). Y: HV; one divider per net.\nAn unused input goes to another input of the same cell; an unused cell: inputs on an LV 0.\nDelays, limits and power: the cell page (plate chokes since TRS v0.58).\nHeater 6.3 V: 3 x 0.4 A on H1/H2. Page: sch/logic/NOR3_N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a6efb0c5-0c2c-4f95-9fd5-18f7832096f5"))

(embedded_fonts no))
